<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>상점 안내 및 쇼핑몰</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      color: #333;
    }
    header {
      background-color: #4A90E2;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      background-color: #357ABD;
    }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      background-color: #2D6193;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
    section {
      background: white;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    h2 {
      border-bottom: 2px solid #4A90E2;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      color: #4A90E2;
    }
    
    /* 쿠폰 스타일 */
    .coupon-card {
      border: 2px dashed #4A90E2;
      background-color: #f0f7ff;
      padding: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    /* 상품 목록 스타일 */
    .product-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .product-card {
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .product-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 150px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .product-card h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 10px 0 5px;
    }
    .product-card p {
      color: #e74c3c;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* 편의시설 스타일 */
    .facility-list {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .facility-item {
      background: #eef2f5;
      padding: 10px 15px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* 길찾기 버튼 스타일 */
    .map-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #2db400; /* 네이버 Green */
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .map-btn.kakao {
      background-color: #FEE500; /* 카카오 Yellow */
      color: #000;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>우리 상점 안내</h1>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#coupons">내 쿠폰</a>
    <a href="#products">상품 목록</a>
    <a href="#facilities">편의시설</a>
    <a href="#location">오시는 길</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="container">

    <section id="coupons">
      <h2>🎫 내 쿠폰함</h2>
      <div class="coupon-card">
        <div>
          <strong>[신규 회원] 10% 할인 쿠폰</strong>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin: 5px 0 0;">전 상품 적용 가능 / 유효기간: ~2026.12.31</p>
        </div>
        <button style="padding: 8px 12px; cursor: pointer;">사용하기</button>
      </div>
      <div class="coupon-card">
        <div>
          <strong>[무료 배송] 배송비 무료 쿠폰</strong>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin: 5px 0 0;">1만원 이상 구매 시</p>
        </div>
        <button style="padding: 8px 12px; cursor: pointer;">사용하기</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="products">
      <h2>🛍️ 대표 상품 목록</h2>
      <div class="product-grid">
        <div class="product-card">
          <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="상품 1">
          <h3>인기 상품 A</h3>
          <p>15,000원</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
          <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="상품 2">
          <h3>추천 상품 B</h3>
          <p>22,000원</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
          <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="상품 3">
          <h3>기획 상품 C</h3>
          <p>9,900원</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
          <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="상품 4">
          <h3>한정판 상품 D</h3>
          <p>35,000원</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="facilities">
      <h2>🏪 편의시설 안내</h2>
      <div class="facility-list">
        <div class="facility-item">📶 무료 Wi-Fi</div>
        <div class="facility-item">🅿️ 무료 주차 가능</div>
        <div class="facility-item">♿ 장애인 편의시설</div>
        <div class="facility-item">🐶 반려동물 동반 가능</div>
        <div class="facility-item">💳 제로페이 / 카드결제 가능</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="location">
      <h2>📍 오시는 길 (길찾기)</h2>
      <p><strong>주소:</strong> 서울특별시 중구 세종대로 110</p>
      <p><strong>영업시간:</strong> 매일 10:00 - 22:00</p>
      
      <div>
        <a href="https://map.naver.com" target="_blank" class="map-btn">네이버 지도로 길찾기</a>
        <a href="https://map.kakao.com" target="_blank" class="map-btn kakao">카카오맵으로 길찾기</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
